    {
      "title": "Mechanism",
      "body": "no_swelling_under_CO2 → stability"
    },
    {
      "title": "Design Rule",
      "body": "[positive] use a temperature-only correlation for CO2 diffusivity in H2O when pressure effects are negligible → simplifies estimation while remaining applicable for practical engineering conditions where pressure has negligible effect on CO2 diffusivity"
    },
    {
      "title": "Design Rule",
      "body": "[positive] validate MD simulation results against experimental data → improves accuracy and reliability of predicted diffusion coefficients under different conditions"
    },
    {
      "title": "Comparison",
